; MULTI.LGO - one program in two files
;
; LOAD reads another file: it defines the procedures in it and runs any
; instructions it has. Here the shapes live in shapes.lgo, next to this
; file, and this file uses them.

load "/examples/shapes.lgo
clearscreen hideturtle
for [i 1 6] [
  setpencolor :i
  house 40 + 15 * :i
  penup right 60 forward 10 pendown
]
